# Lore Pages Example

A simple static site generator that turns .lore markup into HTML.

## URL Links

% Syntax: name | url

GitHub | https://github.com
Rust Language | https://www.rust-lang.org

## Lore Links

% Syntax: name = path

Getting Started = getting-started
Details = details

## Headings

### Level 3 Heading

#### Level 4 Heading

Just a normal paragraph.

## Inner URL Content (foldable)

% Syntax: - title | url   and   + title | url

- Introduction | https://example.com/intro
+ Appendix | https://example.com/appendix

## Inner Lore Content (foldable)

% Syntax: - title = path   and   + title = path

- More Details = details
+ Tips = getting-started

## Other Syntax

% This line is a comment and won't appear in HTML

Line before break
---
Line after break

| https://example.com/sample.png

_ This is placeholder text

### Empty lines between content are preserved
